# Bug round B2 (#2 lakes from space, #4 ocean bands, #5 chaotic beaches): the
# same poses before and after, on the frozen build and on this one, so the
# frames pair up by name. Not a gate; nothing is asserted.
#
#   <exe> --bake DIR --no-save --play scripts/b2-shores.play --out OUT
#
# rec_*: the recorded cameras. Then, straight down over one spot, a ladder of
# heights: each height is drawn at a coarser LOD (the stats panel says which).
# foot_*: standing at the water line, looking along the shore.
mode fly

# --- 041049: lakes from space, and the lake he flew over at the end
at 6.93149 129.60380 8427
skytime 12:00
look 16.89 -76.20
shot rec_041049_start
at 7.90080 129.90078 1548
skytime 12:00
look 16.89 -76.20
shot rec_041049_end
